      "updated": 1729958014611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.In sum.mjs create a simple function called sum which take argument \n    function sum(n1,n2,n3=0,n4=0)\n    {\n        console.log(n1+n2+n3+n4);\n    }\n\n    //export this using the new ES6 syntax:\n    //export {functionName};",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.In sum.mjs create a simple function called sum which take argument \n    function sum(n1,n2,n3=0,n4=0)\n    {\n        console.log(n1+n2+n3+n4);\n    }\n\n    //export this using the new ES6 syntax:\n    //export {functionName};",
