      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1729990715781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nodejs Property which are associated with file:\n----------------------------------------------------\nThere are several nodejs property that are associated with file ie .js\nbut two important one are:\n\n1.__filename\n2.__dirname\n\n__filename fetches the url or the path of the file including the file name \n\nand \n\n__dirname fetches the path of the directory in which file of .js extension reside ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nodejs Property which are associated with file:\n----------------------------------------------------\nThere are several nodejs property that are associated with file ie .js\nbut two important one are:\n\n1.__filename\n2.__dirname\n\n__filename fetches the url or the path of the file including the file name \n\nand \n\n__dirname fetches the path of the directory in which file of .js extension reside ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
