      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gives the absolute path of the file or the folder\nwhich is provided as an parameter a absolute path is\nthe whole path meaning if the file is in c drive \nthe file path will have start from c \n\nif it is in d rive then it will start from d and naviagte \nthrough all the folder which comes in order to get towards \nfile\n\n",
