      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "mv index.js ..\\code2 this is the command used to move the file from\ncode1 to code2 \n\nmv - move\nindex.js-file name which needs to be moved\n\n.. - go back one directory up or move back a directory\n",
