      "text": "fs.readFile , fs.writeFile ,fs.mkdir ,fs.unlink these are async function that means they wont block the flow of \ncode and will pass on the flow of execution to next line after those function to execute it .",
      "fontSize": 42.42864552424871,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "fs.readFile , fs.writeFile ,fs.mkdir ,fs.unlink these are async function that means they wont block the flow of \ncode and will pass on the flow of execution to next line after those function to execute it .",
