      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730111883978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So to avoid this error we can first check if or not \nthe file /folder is available or not if not then only\nwe will use the fs.mkdir() command /code to make directory /folder\n\nto check if a file/folder is present we use fs.existsSync() this \nis a synchronous function in fs module which will return \ntrur or false if the file/folder exists or not",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So to avoid this error we can first check if or not \nthe file /folder is available or not if not then only\nwe will use the fs.mkdir() command /code to make directory /folder\n\nto check if a file/folder is present we use fs.existsSync() this \nis a synchronous function in fs module which will return \ntrur or false if the file/folder exists or not",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
